{"seq":2,"slug":"async-programming","title":"异步编程","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"asyncio-event-loop","title":"asyncio 事件循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/asyncio-event-loop","wordCount":1216,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"coroutines-and-tasks","title":"协程与任务调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/coroutines-and-tasks","wordCount":846,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"async-io","title":"异步 IO 与网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/async-io","wordCount":746,"readingTime":3},{"seq":4,"slug":"concurrency-patterns","title":"并发模式与最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/concurrency-patterns","wordCount":878,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"异步编程-简介\">异步编程 简介</h1><p>Python 异步编程以 asyncio 为核心，通过协程（coroutine）和事件循环（event loop）实现高效的 I/O 并发。本章从底层事件循环机制讲起，覆盖协程调度、异步网络 I/O 和生产级并发模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>01</td>\n<td>asyncio 事件循环</td>\n<td>事件循环原理、运行机制、底层 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>02</td>\n<td>协程与任务调度</td>\n<td>async/await、Task、Future、取消与超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>03</td>\n<td>异步 IO 与网络</td>\n<td>aiohttp、异步文件、数据库驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>04</td>\n<td>并发模式与最佳实践</td>\n<td>gather、TaskGroup、信号量、结构化并发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[事件循环] --&gt; B[协程与 Task]&#10;  B --&gt; C[异步 I/O]&#10;  B --&gt; D[并发模式]&#10;  C --&gt; E[生产级应用]&#10;  D --&gt; E\">graph LR\n  A[事件循环] --&gt; B[协程与 Task]\n  B --&gt; C[异步 I/O]\n  B --&gt; D[并发模式]\n  C --&gt; E[生产级应用]\n  D --&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"核心观点\">核心观点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>协作式调度</strong>：协程在 <code>await</code> 处主动让出控制权，不存在线程切换的开销</li>\n<li><strong>I/O 密集适用</strong>：异步编程最适合网络请求、文件读写等 I/O 密集型任务</li>\n<li><strong>结构化并发</strong>：Python 3.11 引入 TaskGroup，推动从&quot;发射并忘记&quot;到结构化生命周期管理</li>\n<li><strong>生态成熟</strong>：aiohttp、asyncpg、aiofiles 等库已覆盖主流 I/O 场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>Python 生成器与 <code>yield</code> 语法</li>\n<li>基本网络编程概念（TCP、HTTP）</li>\n<li>线程与进程的区别</li>\n</ul>\n"}